            "text": "Set the value of a custom property for a Customer Analytics account. This is an upsert: it replaces the account's current value for the given `definition`, keeping at most one active value per account and definition. Pass `definition` (the custom property definition UUID) and `value` matching the definition's type — a number for number/currency/percent, a boolean for boolean, an ISO-8601 string for date/datetime, or text for text. List or create definitions with `custom-property-definitions-list` and `custom-property-definitions-create`.",
